:1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":2723057090,"text":"また会ったね、元気にしてる？","nextNodeIds":[205190102]},{"nodeId":205190102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":2239745930,"text":"そうそう、今のところジリアンナは良くも悪くもなってない。悪くないのは、まだモンドを離れてないこと…","nextNodeIds":[205190103]},{"nodeId":205190103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":1354259730,"text":"良くないのは、彼女がシスターヴィクトリアに自分のことを告白したけど、ヴィクトリアはまだ何の動きも見せてないこと。","nextNodeIds":[205190104]},{"nodeId":205190104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":3499716906,"text":"この件はどう終わるか、気長に待つしかないかな。","nextNodeIds":[205190105]},{"nodeId":205190105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3721129378,"text":"…なにするつもり？","nextNodeIds":[205190106]},{"nodeId":205190106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":3867046114,"text":"そんな怖い目で見ないでよ、悪者じゃないし。ジリアンナを助ける方法を君に教えたじゃない。","nextNodeIds":[205190107]},{"nodeId":205190107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":2841608730,"text":"さあ、本題に戻るよ。今回君を呼んだのは、前回の件で「ちょっとした問題」が残ったから。","nextNodeIds":[205190108]},{"nodeId":205190108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":1822650738,"text":"簡単に言うと、君が宝盗団を倒したのはいいことだけど、「ジリアンナがモンドにいる」ということを明らかにしたと同じよ。","nextNodeIds":[205190109]},{"nodeId":205190109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":1425703522,"text":"宝盗団は裏切り者を放っておくわけがない。私の知る限り、モンド周辺には宝盗団の痕跡が複数あって、しかも見たことのないやつらばかりよ。","nextNodeIds":[205190110]},{"nodeId":205190110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":2290571538,"text":"おそらくジリアンナを狙って、ついでに復讐するつもりでしょうね。こんな危険なやつらは、君に倒してもらうしかないわ。","nextNodeIds":[205190111,205190113,205190115]},{"nodeId":205190111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1013576530,"text":"そっちが悪いよ。","nextNodeIds":[205190112]},{"nodeId":205190112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":2465176418,"text":"まあまあ、こっちだって命令通りに動いただけだから。あの方がどうしても君がいいって言わなきゃ、私も君に頼んだりしないよ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":205190113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":2551616314,"text":"自分でなんとかして。","nextNodeIds":[205190114]},{"nodeId":205190114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":1141417786,"text":"そんな悲しいこと言わないでよ、君みたいに実力を持ってるわけじゃないし。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":205190115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3454928338,"text":"それは西風騎士団の管轄だよ。","nextNodeIds":[205190116]},{"nodeId":205190116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":433202130,"text":"それはそうだけど、ジリアンナのことを知ってる人は少ない方がいいって、あの方がそうおっしゃったもの。","nextNodeIds":[205190117]},{"nodeId":205190117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":2983272778,"text":"それに、あの方は騎士団を巻き込むことを望んでない。なにせ…西風騎士団のやり方だと、余計大げさになりがちだからね。","nextNodeIds":[205190118]},{"nodeId":205190118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":1780529474,"text":"たとえばホフマンとか、宝盗団がモンド周辺に現れたって聞いたら、きっとすぐに騎士団本部に報告するに決まってる。","nextNodeIds":[205190119]},{"nodeId":205190119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":2792476450,"text":"もし騎士団がそのまま出撃したら、宝盗団も一目散に逃げるでしょ。宝盗団を一網打尽する計画も白紙に戻るわ。","nextNodeIds":[205190120]},{"nodeId":205190120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":1179951562,"text":"だから、今回は君の「単独行動」で、効率よく倒してもらうしかないの。","nextNodeIds":[205190121]},{"nodeId":205190121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":3239753706,"text":"でも…あの宝盗団がモンドの近くまで来るなんて、西風騎士団もとうに気付いて、行動を準備してるかもしれないわね…","nextNodeIds":[205190122]},{"nodeId":205190122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":73236578,"text":"まあ、それは私たちの知ったことではないけど。","nextNodeIds":[205190123]},{"nodeId":205190123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":2677067426,"text":"まあまあ、安心して、今回はちゃんとした報酬を用意したから。","nextNodeIds":[205190124]},{"nodeId":205190124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":4027476618,"text":"今回はあの方からモラをたくさんもらったからね。前回なんて自費だったもん…そうだ、宝盗団の位置を標記しておくよ。","nextNodeIds":[205190125]},{"nodeId":205190125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1525,"speakerName":"ヴァル","textMapHash":3009955562,"text":"じゃあ、モラに免じて、ジリアンナ、ルドルフ、そしてリリーとモンドを守る任務は任せたよ。頑張れ。","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":2051906,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","beginCond":[{"param":["2051904","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["2051901","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":